        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Ferrimagnetic {Dy4Cr2} single-molecule magnet with slow relaxation, Ueff = 17.1(3) K (12 cm−1), τ0 = 4.75(2)×10−7 s, and a step-like hysteresis loop (Hc = 0.1 T at 0.4 K, 14 Oe s−1). Inelastic neutron scattering shows quantized spin-wave excitations at 3.63, 5.61, 8.28 and 11.76 cm−1 (108, 176, 246 and 352 GHz), fitted by L&E-band theory with Δ/2 = 2.08 cm−1 and ε(q) = 2.5 cm−1. The quantum tunneling gap is restricted below 3.8×10−7 cm−1 through nine levels.",
